---
kind: scene
id: shop.morning
title: Breakfast at the shop
on: dayStart
once: false
components: [../components/day-card.component.lute]
---

## Breakfast

<match on="run.day">
  <when is="1">
    ::use{component="dayCard" day=@today weather="grey, gulls arguing on the roof"}
  </when>
  <when is="2">
    ::use{component="dayCard" day=@today weather="windy; the shop sign squeaks on its hinge"}
  </when>
  <when is="3">
    ::use{component="dayCard" day=@today weather="still, the bay flat as a plate"}
  </when>
  <when is="4">
    ::use{component="dayCard" day=@today weather="rain, the kind that means it"}
  </when>
  <when is="5">
    ::use{component="dayCard" day=@today weather="clear all the way to the lighthouse"}
  </when>
  <when is="6">
    ::use{component="dayCard" day=@today weather="hot already, and it is not yet eight"}
  </when>
  <when is="7">
    ::use{component="dayCard" day=@today weather="overcast; the bus timetable flaps in the shelter"}
  </when>
</match>

::auto{character="pell" anchor="left" action="fadeInUp"}
::set{run.seen.pell = run.day}
<match on="run.day">
  <when is="..2">
    @pell: Toast's on the side. The frame won't make itself.
  </when>
  <when is="3">
    @pell{emotion="teasing"}: Wednesday. Library delivery day, if anyone's keeping track.
  </when>
  <when is="4">
    @pell: One more day. Don't panic. Panic later.
  </when>
  <when is="5">
    @pell{emotion="happy"}: Walk's at dusk. Wear the blue shirt, not that thing.
  </when>
  <when is="6">
    @pell: Market's on. Take a basket, bring back peaches, keep the change.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @pell{emotion="sad"}: Last day. Pack tonight and I'll pretend not to watch.
  </otherwise>
</match>
::auto{character="pell" action="fadeOut"}
